%
% CGC QGRAF style file
% Output format: machine-parsable diagram descriptor
%
% Format specification:
%   <header>   → diagram_count
%   <diagram>  → diagram_index \n n_v n_p n_1pi \n vertices... \n propagators...
%   <back>     → blank line
%   <epilogue> → empty
%
% QGRAF style macro reference:
%   `diagram_index`     diagram counter
%   `nv'                number of vertices in this diagram
%   `np'                number of propagators in this diagram
%   `n1pi'              number of 1PI subdiagrams
%   `field(idx)'        field name of vertex idx
%   `vertex(idx,jdx)'   jdx-th field at vertex idx
%   `vlist`             list of vertex values
%   `plist`             list of propagator values

<header>
<diagram count>
<back>
<diagram>
  `diagram_index'
  `nv' `np' `n1pi'
<vertex list>
<propagator list>
<back>
<epilogue>
